msgid ""
"No change was saved: the form named a setting outside the tab you were "
"editing, so saving it would have written into a scope you did not open. "
"Reload the page, open that tab, and try again — nothing was written."
msgstr ""
"Es wurde nichts gespeichert: Das Formular nannte eine Einstellung "
"außerhalb des Reiters, den du bearbeitet hast; beim Speichern wäre sie in"
